WEBVTT

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.040
Is Busujima-kun crying?!

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.420
Maybe he lost one of his 
buddies in a turf war...

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.040
Eiji!

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.840
You forgot your gym clothes 
at home this morning.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.880
Your big sister brought them for you!

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.710
Gah!

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.460
Didn't I tell you not to come to
the first-year classrooms, Sis?!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.380
Oh dear, you're so heartless.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.710
Would you just get out of here already?!

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.670
Aw... Your poor big sister...

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:49.020
DUDE, THE FREAKIN' THUG
HAS A SMOKING-HOT SISTER
WITH CRAZY HUGE BOOBS
-US POOR SAPS

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.290
Dude, the freakin' thug

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.810
Has a smoking-hot sister

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.080
With crazy huge boobs...!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Poem 2:              Nanako's Diet

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:57.210
Alrighty, so...

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.760
Per Eiji's request,

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:02.640
Help Eiji Busujima Become More Popular

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.420
this is our theme for the day.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.640
Thanks very much!

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.080
You just can't seem to shake
that "scary" image of yours, huh?

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:09.380
I mean, I like to think 
I'm a pretty nice person.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.920
Alright then, use that appeal 
and turn it into a poem. Go!

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:16.960
If I were to split

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.190
This here popsicle like so,

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:19.150
I'd give you this half

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:20.710
That's totally weak!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:28.390
Help Eiji Busujima Become More Popular

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.230
So you know how they have the

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.710
"Karai High Rankings"
list on the school website?

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:29.870
You're ranked #2 in terms of

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.100
the disconnect between your tough 
exterior and club affiliation.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.710
Who's ranked #1?!

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.500
We could probably spin it as a positive
and call it a cute "gap" of sorts...

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.290
But since you're only #2, 
it might not pan out...

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.500
"Gap"...?

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.050
Most women these days

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:45.950
Are really attracted to

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.290
A cute "gap" like that!

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.090
Nanako-chan, can you think of anything?

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:54.390
Like, an area where Eiji-kun
could use some improvement.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.930
Well, I think Ei-chan

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.330
Is perfectly fine to stay

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.750
Just the way he is

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.450
Okay, if you HAD to pick something?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.150
Every so often,
When he's super deep in thought,
His eyes roll backwards!

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:06.600
Every so often,

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.990
When he's super deep in thought,

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.000
His eyes roll backwards!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:10.540
Th-they do?!

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.580
Yeah, that's definitely freaky...

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.090
Hold on, I don't remember ever doing that!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.090
Really? Not even once?

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.130
I guess it's possible...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.220
There it is! You're doing it right now!

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:29.100
Well... maybe I'm asking too much.
Maybe I'm just not a likeable person.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:31.920
But I can think of

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:32.980
A lot of good qualities

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.230
About you, Ei-chan!

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:36.800
Whenever you split

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.620
A donut to share with me,

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.940
You give me this half!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.510
Whenever you share

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.090
A refreshing drink with me,

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.400
You pour it like this!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.450
Oh, man... I really am lame...

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.130
Hello there, everyone!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.890
Thanks for always looking out for Eiji.

00:03:56.890 --> 00:03:59.590
I'm his big sister, Koto Ohtsuki.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.290
Cut the crap, would you?!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.550
You and I have just been 
friends since we were kids!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.700
I changed your diapers, I'll have you know.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.310
We're only two years apart. 
There's no freakin' way!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:13.170
More importantly, Eiji...
are you paying attention in class?

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:17.040
Look, you've got sleep in your eyes! Jeez...

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.120
Do you have any tissues?
I'll make sure to give you some.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.210
I have medicine in my bag,
so let me know if you start feeling sick, okay?

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.060
C'mon, you're embarrassing 
me! Go home already!

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.880
I... I can't look away...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.850
Would you like to go

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.200
And get some tea or something

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.250
With us after this?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.830
My, how sweet of you!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.590
But I'll have to pass. I have 
a club meeting to attend.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:41.080
What club are you in, Koto-san?

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.470
The American Armed Forces Combative Club.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.710
Ranked #1 in the gap between
outward appearance and club affiliation...

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.230
It's gotta be her!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:57.950
By the way, Ei-chan,

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.140
Do you have a girlfriend or

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:00.170
A special someone?

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.460
Huh?! What kind of nonsense are you-

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.330
Aw, it's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.080
Humans have been fartin' as 
long as they've been livin'.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.620
A Taste
of Spring
Fair

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.250
Hey, Nanako. You wanna grab a bite?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.380
Didn't you tell me you don't like onions?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.670
I'm doing my best

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:25.570
To overcome my weakness

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:26.790
And improve myself!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.670
Oh, good for you!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.250
You sure got a big appetite.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.960
Come to think of it...
you're gettin' a little round in the middle.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.170
A Taste
of Spring
Fair

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.830
Big Sis, time for breakfast!

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:10.520
Hey Hiro-kun,

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.710
Do you think that I might've

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.640
Gained a little weight?

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:16.350
N-Nanako's dieting?! C-could this mean...?!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.310
Huh? I dunno about that, 
but you do eat a whole lot.

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.790
You scarf down more food than
the up-and-coming sumo wrestlers on TV!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.500
Dosukoi!

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.270
Maybe you should try small-

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.270
Oh, God! What's with the angry face?!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:31.880
You shouldn't be worrying about your weight.
You're still growing, after all.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.140
D-Dad?

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.550
It's fine. He always does this.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.380
Huh? A diet?

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.210
Sure, I've gone on diets before, but...

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.630
Which lucky dog are you trying
to slim down for, anyway?

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.610
Though something tells me 
it's probably Eiji-kun...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:56.970
That's not it at all!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:57.850
I want to show off for you,

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:58.680
President Amane!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.020
H-huh?! M-me?!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.750
Well, I wouldn't exactly mind.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:09.850
Huh? The secret to a nice body?
But Nanako-chan, you're super slender!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.140
Oh, it must be for Eiji.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.770
Aw, you're so adorable!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.040
Okay then...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.840
If you want a flatter stomach,
how about we try some sit-ups?

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.470
Leave it to me, Coach!

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:27.670
I'll tackle any challenge

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.800
You can throw at me!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.620
Let's start with 30!
 Just take it at your own pace.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:33.840
Go!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.080
Let me hug you, just one time!

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:45.900
Nanako-chan!

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.230
Oh, it's Nanako and Big Sis Koto.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:48.920
They're training...?

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.800
If they wanted to exercise, 
they shoulda just told me...

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:03.430
And that's how you snap an attacker's neck
if he comes at you with a knife!

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:05.790
The hell is she teaching her?!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.630
Yo, Big Sis Koto! What 
are you and Nanako doing?

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.710
It's a secret!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.220
B-but why?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.350
Jeez, you're so oblivious...

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.250
Huh...?

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.000
She's doing this for you, you know.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:22.980
For me...?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:24.940
Then that means...!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.880
Nanako wants to snap my neck?!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.880
ONE
WEEK
LATER

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:34.830
S'up?

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.080
Uh, what's with the serious face?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:46.970
N-no way... Please don't kill me...!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.040
Huh?!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.490
So, what do you think?!

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:53.800
Isn't my stomach flatter

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.040
Than it was before?!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.990
Um, I dunno what to say...

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.980
I've never touched a girl's stomach before...

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.380
President, is that...

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.080
Huh?! N-no! I, uh-!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.150
...a disguise?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.710
By the way, is there a reason
you don't have a boyfriend, Koto-san?

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.420
Why the sudden interest, President?

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.150
I'm just kinda curious.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:41.270
You're cute and you have a nice figure...

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:43.460
There's about a million reasons
why someone would like you.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.330
Oh my, you flatter me! Are you hitting on me?

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.420
I didn't mean it like that!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.490
I'm not all that great.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.990
There are plenty of girls 
out there cuter than I am.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:57.330
I dunno...

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.420
Koto-san, could it be... that 
there's someone you like?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.340
Someone I like...?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.970
My name's Eiji.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:13.680
Whadda 'bout you?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.180
Nope.

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:20.020
Then...

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:22.290
And even if there was,

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.680
I think the way things are now 
works best for both of us.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.640
Huh? What's that mean?

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.660
I mean... I am his big sister, after all.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.960
Well? Whadda 'bout you?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.820
Hey! You ought to address me 
with a little more respect.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.040
How come?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.700
Because I'm older than you.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.880
Then what am I s'posed to call you?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.360
Hmm...

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:52.790
You may call me "Big Sister Koto."

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.710
Big Sis Koto...?

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.490
Sure, close enough.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.780
On the next epi-

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.400
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.480
Let's Go to the A-

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:10.860
-musement Park!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.710
Next Time, Poem 3
"Let's Go to the Amusement Park"
